{"id":"v06-01","volume":6,"volumeTitle":"卷六","volumeSubtitle":"汉文","index":1,"title":{"t":"高帝求賢詔","s":"高帝求贤诏"},"book":{"t":"西漢文","s":"西汉文"},"sourceHead":{"t":"","s":""},"author":"西汉","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"我听说，行王道的君主没有高过周文王的，称霸的诸侯没有高过齐桓公的，他们都是靠贤人帮助才成就名声。","tokens":[{"t":"蓋","s":"盖","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"聞","s":"闻","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"者","s":"者","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"莫","s":"莫","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"高","s":"高","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"於","s":"于","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"周","s":"周","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"文","s":"文","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"伯","s":"伯","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"者","s":"者","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"莫","s":"莫","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"高","s":"高","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"於","s":"于","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"齊","s":"齐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"桓","s":"桓","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"皆","s":"皆","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"待","s":"待","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"賢","s":"贤","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"人","s":"人","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"而","s":"而","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"成","s":"成","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"名","s":"名","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"如今天下贤人的智慧和才能，难道只有古人才具备吗？问题在于君主不肯同他们交往，士人又从哪里得到进用呢？","tokens":[{"t":"今","s":"今","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"天","s":"天","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"下","s":"下","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"賢","s":"贤","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"者","s":"者","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"智","s":"智","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"能","s":"能","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"豈","s":"岂","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"特","s":"特","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"古","s":"古","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"人","s":"人","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"乎","s":"乎","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"患","s":"患","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"在","s":"在","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"人","s":"人","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"主","s":"主","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"不","s":"不","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"交","s":"交","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"故","s":"故","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"也","s":"也","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"士","s":"士","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"奚","s":"奚","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"由","s":"由","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"進","s":"进","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"现在我凭着上天的神灵，也凭着贤士大夫，平定了天下，使四海成为一家，希望这种局面长久保持，世世代代